{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_21e67efe5d4d6fe8784c89b46b0b035f1fbca26d35022154606927dcea8877fa","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"microsoft/webwright@bc26750af3ad snapshot 884112d832b1b36a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1e68d33be009cfc24c96dd2a7098791598629dccef9154c0b212ddfa5351ea57"],"source_ids":["src_21b70ef63cd25f278edb3c8aaa7227d4"],"text":"Runtime dependencies are stated as just httpx, pydantic, playwright, and typer, with model backends for OpenAI, Anthropic, and OpenRouter each around 150-200 lines.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2b97a3d0d45b9a3ea0f1e1e9a3cb83f053a01015491ff17648d691995e94567b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"microsoft/webwright@bc26750af3ad snapshot 884112d832b1b36a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0ca97796473737b9e2d2b9b43cdb247f7120b2631c52348f87de7a10ae6d4ed1","slc_898db060724d8e7d9fd58bb156b41087db2e39c66e172997246a14a7341eca12","slc_9ef65b1c337a6a9bb28c5db63ff2ee314cdd45186cde6531eec64349cc65c248"],"source_ids":["src_21b70ef63cd25f278edb3c8aaa7227d4"],"text":"The Skill Factory distills each solved task's script into reusable, verified, parameterized code skills that run standalone without a model (~40 s, zero tokens); a recommend/route step checks the library out of the agent loop, either running a matching skill directly or injecting it as a prompt hint.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2c4826f8b3bec51a6a4d036eda2d81569ddda8b391a046c473dbf67e6abceda2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"microsoft/webwright@bc26750af3ad snapshot 884112d832b1b36a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_757032809fd3c431b6ff3781a9aa931dd73bc9707d263936e217520cfaf4b029"],"source_ids":["src_21b70ef63cd25f278edb3c8aaa7227d4"],"text":"A plain base.yaml run writes trajectory.json and debug artifacts, while adding the task_showcase.yaml config additionally generates a report.json with structured output for the Flask dashboard.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3cf84102354995f2eb11d3ec01cc30f3b1719db5e1ab264b9ce2159ae8ecce03","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"microsoft/webwright@bc26750af3ad snapshot 884112d832b1b36a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2db6fe32540f3fceb2d339062fa131e1517e8e97e667994e7319c478c72e47bf","slc_55fc3938a8cf74a1ee2df2aaf5207c0ff0562c1c9216dc4f654be4c67f709fd2","slc_f46b81c53c4e3cb14be611dc72ccd3e3d489934f43f0c13f15f3a0a79fc77e1c"],"source_ids":["src_21b70ef63cd25f278edb3c8aaa7227d4"],"text":"A small Flask app under assets/task_showcase/ renders repeatable-run results (task.json plus report.json per task folder) as a dashboard, served locally on port 5005 and configurable to point at a run's generated tasks directory.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_48072d58fd737cb1717a44c97737307f0fb3620f8db48868e1513b062cee9686","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"microsoft/webwright@bc26750af3ad snapshot 884112d832b1b36a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5bd7bf4d6ad164a5f9b1516140824dec6f8dd37bc0b2a63b96d91276c2cec575","slc_9178831f5dc1b3a037ace33ffe805607fdf9a89b5fc0eb2c5161433aa2f4ef78"],"source_ids":["src_21b70ef63cd25f278edb3c8aaa7227d4"],"text":"Reported benchmark results: 86.7% on Online-Mind2Web (300 tasks) with GPT-5.4 and 84.7% with Claude Opus 4.7; 60.1% on Odysseys (200 long-horizon tasks) with GPT-5.4, +15.6 points over prior SOTA, using a 100-step budget.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6de17261b6a12a818ffa1d760865cdde4698407a4db76594551f87f2b9e416ed","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"microsoft/webwright@bc26750af3ad snapshot 884112d832b1b36a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9b10c1dfeb0f2c074d1485de30e24c6e951c60dd01d0ec364e70e0c2393f6cb6"],"source_ids":["src_21b70ef63cd25f278edb3c8aaa7227d4"],"text":"In plugin mode, the host agent drives the Webwright loop natively with no extra LLM API key beyond the host subscription, and hosts that natively read PNG screenshots can skip the image_qa/self_reflection tools.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8dd3c0c153b990970356944572c932b6f82a273fd00144154a88223d31093031","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"microsoft/webwright@bc26750af3ad snapshot 884112d832b1b36a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1e68d33be009cfc24c96dd2a7098791598629dccef9154c0b212ddfa5351ea57","slc_5d5e171e4546eebd57218a7ec3100611d56d2b750365cf3c0e67385fcc453976"],"source_ids":["src_21b70ef63cd25f278edb3c8aaa7227d4"],"text":"The project advertises a minimal footprint with no multi-agent system, graph engine, plugin layer, or hidden orchestration; the core agent loop is a single ~450-line file, the Playwright environment ~570 lines, and the CLI ~150 lines.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9dc1dcb3412fdef7d25d992e5bc6dbf91fe32fe33aa6b12e411a8e7d25c3326b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"microsoft/webwright@bc26750af3ad snapshot 884112d832b1b36a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2ce2cf1997d435396a7e24db653dd653d63d2fa52f88ac3da493e8efbe9189ae","slc_44a0e0b4842bcb927fddad3ca591a21ea4a3bf860aa18af69c43377f638a0ad7","slc_7b18fb4cb7222f4f53f39a9f4a958c338167b0cb6d04945281a9e6a55d2d7f36"],"source_ids":["src_21b70ef63cd25f278edb3c8aaa7227d4"],"text":"Repository development practice: prerequisites are Python 3.10+, Chromium installed via Playwright, and an API key for the chosen backend; installation is `pip install -e .` followed by `playwright install chromium`, and the image_qa/self_reflection tools reuse the configured backend model so no extra key is needed.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","created_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a1adf00c7c8e70ef365071052c8be0c7f462dec86b64b0a2551ea549d38cf121","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"microsoft/webwright@bc26750af3ad snapshot 884112d832b1b36a","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1b6062a0e9c8c558e7e2406777c2644c8e20351840c4fd3a2a88c91cc21e9c80","slc_39356c41d3bfc0cea172111dec4142396a3e78292dc13e35c5ea1146d1b20e98","slc_c9c1823366f8cbc1ca13d42fa2e7dfcf509c278c673413cdef6d72fac4bbf304"],"source_ids":["src_e2714778e82f5c9ca01611804a5f53c2"],"text":"Manual mode (`update`) lets users write templates, declare parameters, and set per-run admit verdicts themselves, supporting benchmarks with known answers, non-exact-match judging, and login-gated sites whose credentials are carried into replay but never stored in the skill.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:18:47Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b10939b97790482c8557ec3f863024e1"}
